[34m[38;5;88m    [34m[38;5;28m 16 [34m[32m        --dark       Use diff highlighting colors appropriate for a dark terminal background.[0m
[34m[38;5;88m    [34m[38;5;28m 17 [34m[32m    -h, --help       Prints help information[0m
[34m[38;5;88m    [34m[38;5;28m 18 [34m[32m        --light      Use diff highlighting colors appropriate for a light terminal background. This is the default.[0m
